SUMMARY:MST: Lane Pinnacle\, 8 miles
DESCRIPTION:The Asheville Hiking Group\nTrailhead is Tanbark Tunnel on the
  BRP. From Tanbark Tunnel\, we take the MST spur trail up to Rattlesnake L
 odge and then the MST over Rich Knob\, Wolf Den\, and then up to Lane Pinn
 acle where we have views of the North Fork Reservoir and its surrounding w
 atershed. Then we turn around and head back down.\n\nDistance out and up i
 s approximately 4 miles (8 miles round trip)\, and the elevation out and u
 p is approximately 2\,000 feet.\n\n**2\,000 feet elevation gain is no mean
  feat**. Most of the gain up to Rich Knob\, about 1\,700 feet\, is in the 
 first 2 miles--gives new meaning to the term "unrelenting." The rest is up
  and down to Lane Pinnacle. So . . . 2\,000 feet up and 2\,000 feet down o
 ver 8 miles.\n\n**Car pool:** Meet at Folk Art Center\, **lower parking le
 vel** at 8:30. Limited parking at the trail head.\n\n**RELEASE OF LIABILIT
 Y:** The organizer of this trip is a volunteer and not a professional guid
 e. The function of the organizer is only to organize this trip. If you sig
 n up or participate in this event you acknowledge that you freely and volu
 ntarily agree to assume all risks of injuries\, illnesses\, and damages ar
 ising from\, as a result of\, and associated with this event. In addition\
 , you acknowledge that you agree to the Meetup Terms of Service: [https://
 help.meetup.com/hc/en-us/articles/360027447252-Terms-of-Service#h_9e385395
 -a405-4361-8afc-854a4f586c82.](https://help.meetup.com/hc/en-us/articles/3
 60027447252-Terms-of-Service#h_9e385395-a405-4361-8afc-854a4f586c82.)\n\n*
 *Trail profile credit:** Walt Weber's*Trail Profiles and Maps*\, 2nd ed.
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.meetup.com/ashevillehikinggroup/events/316167605
 /
